{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Forest Time\u2013a game in which turn-based tactical gameplay is made cozy and peaceful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide variety of gentle tactical puzzles, charming characters, and a warm atmosphere. Carefully plan your actions to get everything done in a limited number of turns, or experiment and explore. The game doesn't punish mistakes, so you can learn by trying things out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/093f388ad3d629690d5fc33b8ca77676.avif?t=1764053572\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Family-friendly and cozy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relaxed pacing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turn-based gameplay with plenty of time to consider your actions and experiment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A variety of task-based puzzles that reward careful planning and clever use of the character's abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Distinct characters to meet and play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seasonal and thematic levels (including a Halloween set)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 40 puzzles now with a wide variety of tasks: gathering fruits, helping neighbors, trick-or-treating, or hunting for hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/bf9a0a8beb330e356e096e1bfad9d61d.avif?t=1764053572\" width=756 height=166 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's next</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for stopping by\u2014we hope our game brings you a few cozy minutes and a smile. Forest Time is an indie game made by a small team of dedicated people. If you like our Demo, please wishlist the game or follow us on social media to hear about new levels and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planned release date is by the end of 2025. However, we intend to continue working on the game and add more puzzles in 2026.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3166730?t=1764053572","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3166730?t=1764053572","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/609590c49bc35df2b6b548d653c9273ae00aefb3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764053572","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/609590c49bc35df2b6b548d653c9273ae00aefb3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764053572","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Forest Time\u2013a game in which turn-based tactical gameplay is made cozy and peaceful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide variety of gentle tactical puzzles, charming characters, and a warm atmosphere. Carefully plan your actions to get everything done in a limited number of turns, or experiment and explore. The game doesn't punish mistakes, so you can learn by trying things out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/093f388ad3d629690d5fc33b8ca77676.avif?t=1764053572\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Family-friendly and cozy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Relaxed pacing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turn-based gameplay with plenty of time to consider your actions and experiment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A variety of task-based puzzles that reward careful planning and clever use of the character's abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Distinct characters to meet and play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Seasonal and thematic levels (including a Halloween set)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 40 puzzles now with a wide variety of tasks: gathering fruits, helping neighbors, trick-or-treating, or hunting for hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/extras/bf9a0a8beb330e356e096e1bfad9d61d.avif?t=1764053572\" width=756 height=166 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's next</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for stopping by\u2014we hope our game brings you a few cozy minutes and a smile. Forest Time is an indie game made by a small team of dedicated people. If you like our Demo, please wishlist the game or follow us on social media to hear about new levels and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planned release date is by the end of 2025. However, we intend to continue working on the game and add more puzzles in 2026.</p>","developers":["Wandering Peak"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166730/9ed631a832a35cd9e00cb65c35e69bbc46d4cbb7/header.jpg?t=1764053572","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04+ or equvalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.15+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.50Ghz Intel core i3, Apple M1 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br>